      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 748a723a3a7f179113d925e3c602ea17176acacd\nparent 6c7e464293b9cd9b14d24931de1bf86856ec737d\nauthor Fabian Jahr <fjahr@protonmail.com> 1794491516 +0100\ncommitter Fabian Jahr <fjahr@protonmail.com> 1794491516 +0100\n\nmempool: Reject cluster limits below 1\n\n-limitclustercount=0 or -nolimitclustercount passed the upper bound check and triggered an assertion in TxGraph when mempool sanity checks are enabled, while -limitclustersize=0 or -nolimitclustersize made every transaction fail with a misleading error. Reject both at startup.\n",
