      "message": "init: Disable the automatic onion service with -notorcontrol\n\n-notorcontrol made the node connect to the Tor control port at \"0\", i.e. 0.0.0.0:9051, which reaches a local Tor on most systems. Set -listenonion=0 instead and reject combining it with -listenonion=1, like -listen=0 does.",
